### Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/metrics

### Create job
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "report_generation",
  "payload": {
    "duration_seconds": 10
  }
}

### Jobs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs

### Get job
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/job-1

### Cancel job
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/job-1/cancel

### Delete completed job
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/job-1
